    "summary": "Costs 2 CP. As your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or either [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) starts, choose a pair of your **GENESTEALER CULTS** units you haven’t picked for shooting or fighting this phase. Mark one enemy. If you use this in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase), both chosen units must have the enemy within [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range). For the phase their models can attack only the marked unit and only with attacks that can legally target it. Those attacks get +1 to [Wound rolls](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls).",
